# Agdi CODEOWNERS
#
# AGENTS.md states: "Do not edit files covered by security-focused CODEOWNERS
# rules unless a listed owner explicitly asked for the change or is already
# reviewing it with you. Treat those paths as restricted surfaces, not drive-by
# cleanup." This file defines those surfaces. Before 2026-09-22 it did not exist,
# so every path AGENTS.md described as restricted was unenforced.
#
# Agdi currently has a single maintainer, so every rule names the same owner.
# The value of the file today is that the restricted surfaces are declared
# explicitly and a future co-maintainer can be granted a narrower set.
#
# Syntax reference: https://docs.github.com/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default owner for everything not matched below.
*                                             @anassagd432

# --- Security and vulnerability handling -------------------------------------
# Changing these changes the project's stated security posture, disclosure
# process, or the tooling that enforces it.
/SECURITY.md                                  @anassagd432
/SUPPORT.md                                   @anassagd432
/docs/security/                               @anassagd432
